illustrates → Problem; involves → ST-01, ST-03, ST-04, SA-01, SA-05; reimagined-as → DS-03 (§2.1).

= References =

* Bora et al. (2015); Lundin-Olsson et al. (1997); Mental Health Foundation (2016); Orange et al. (1996). See a1.1 References.
